<view class="page"><view class="balance"><text>我的星星积分</text><text class="balance-number">⭐ {{points}}</text></view><view class="shop-note">在建议食用日期内吃完食材，可获得 XP 和星星积分。</view><view class="products"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="product card"><view class="product-icon" style="background:{{item.color}}22">{{item.icon}}</view><view class="grow"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="type">{{item.type}} · Lv.{{item.unlockLevel}} 解锁</text><text class="price">⭐ {{item.price}}</text></view><button class="buy {{item.owned?'owned':''}}" disabled="{{item.owned||item.locked}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="buy">{{item.owned?'已拥有':item.locked?'未解锁':'兑换'}}</button></view></view></view>
